<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-St Barbara Mines half yr net drops.</title>
<headline>RTRS-St Barbara Mines half yr net drops.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half ended Dec 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  5.74 vs  14.63</p>
<p>    Net profit			  3.07 vs   8.73</p>
<p>    Sales				41.56 vs  39.53</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			 1.46 vs   4.16</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name - St Barbara Mines Ltd. St Barbara produced 68,936 ounces of gold in the half vs 63,830 a year earlier at average cash mine cost of A$394 an ounce vs A$422. Average price received A$620 an ounce vs unstated.</p>
